# bge-m3 SEBI fine-tuning intervention (.claude/plans/deep-analyse-and-
# research-bright-dawn.md): mined pairs and the merged model are large,
# regenerable data artifacts. holdout_docs.json is the one exception - it's
# small and is the contamination-boundary audit trail other scripts assert
# against, so it stays tracked even though the rest of data/finetune/ is not.
